	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"2021年４月に地上波にてアニメ放送開始の『86－エイティシックス－』より、主人公達が搭乗する戦闘機械「ジャガーノート」が1/48スケールで登場！",
			"• 原作ベースのハイディテール表現",
			"• 各部の可動で多彩なアクションが可能",
			"• 長距離砲撃に特化した「遠距離タイプ滑腔砲」を装備。砲身の長さは約250mmで、折り曲げギミックを搭載。",
			"• 遠距離砲撃仕様には「重機関銃」が付属。",
			"• ジャガーノートと同スケールで支援機スカベンジャーと、クレナとレーナのフィギュアが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"86-Eighty Six-\", which will begin airing on terrestrial TV in 20214, the fighting machine \"Juggernaut\" piloted by the main characters is now available in 1/48 scale!",
			"• High-detail expression based on the original work",
			"• Each part is movable, allowing for a variety of actions.",
			"• Equipped with a \"long-range type smoothbore cannon\" specialized for long-range bombardment. The length of the gun barrel is approximately 250mm, and it is equipped with a bending gimmick.",
			"• The long-range bombardment version comes with a \"heavy machine gun\".",
			"• Comes with support aircraft Scavenger and figures of Crenna and Lena in the same scale as Juggernaut."
		]
	},
